{"id":245869757792894,"type":"album","name":"Knife Play","artist":"Xiu Xiu","year":2002,"weight":20,"info":{"cover":"https://dn711308.ca.archive.org/0/items/mbid-9ebfb95a-0e15-4682-83b2-24740311dc0e/mbid-9ebfb95a-0e15-4682-83b2-24740311dc0e-16161873179.jpg","kind":"Album","tracks":11,"country":"US","scaruffi":7.0,"aoty":79,"aoty_user":81,"yt":"ooJJ684dnUA","links":{"youtube":"https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_m-avJ_O-5GTchqVnz66cF79Xa5WMbRIyA","bandcamp":"https://xiuxiu.bandcamp.com/album/knife-play","rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/xiu-xiu/knife-play","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/1390-xiu-xiu-knife-play.php"},"desc":"Knife Play is the debut studio album by Xiu Xiu, released on February 19, 2002. A sticker on the cover of the album reads \"When my mom died I listened to Henry Cowell, Joy Division, Detroit techno, the Smiths, Takemitsu, Sabbath, Gamelan, 'Black Angels' and Cecil Taylor\". The title is a reference to knife play. Noted themes include familial dysfunction, violence and despair; \"Hives Hives\" is a cover of the IBOPA song \"Hives\" that references AIDS and HIV, and \"Dr. Troll\" is about a young transgender girl who teaches a class of preschoolers. \"Suha\" is about the titular 25-year old ."},"artist_ref":{"id":26966574139348,"name":"Xiu Xiu","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":226054802434556,"type":"genre","name":"Post-Punk","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":755,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":191826593279813,"type":"genre","name":"Art Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":531,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":55893123468232,"type":"genre","name":"Experimental Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":373,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":260819262438325,"type":"genre","name":"synth-pop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":325,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":26147917429442,"type":"genre","name":"Minimal Synth","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":207,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"